== How this is built ==

* Schemas: [[Schema:Publication]], [[Schema:Author]], [[Schema:Institution]], [[Schema:Project]]
* Layout: [[Layout:PublicationOverview]]
* See the source of one publication: [{{fullurl:Linked Bibliography Mappings for European Archives|action=edit}} Edit Linked Bibliography Mappings for European Archives]
* The featured infoboxes use <code><nowiki>{{#view}}</nowiki></code>. The tables come from SPARQL queries via [[Module:NeoWikiDemo]].
